{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00382","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 三 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾仪混成冲邃，天道下济高明。\n闓阳晨披紫阙，太一晓降黄庭。\n圆坛敢[申]昭报，方璧冀展虔情。\n丹禁式敷衷恳，玄鉴庶察微诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}